{"text": "Madame Forestier went to her wardrobe, took out a large jewel box, and said, Choose, my dear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly, in a black satin box, she found a superb diamond necklace, and her heart began to beat with desire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Can you lend me this, only this, she asked, and her friend said, Why, yes, of course. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the ball Madame Loisel was a great success, for she was prettier than all the other women. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All the men looked at her and asked her name, and even the Minister noticed her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She danced wildly, drunk with pleasure, in a cloud of happiness made of all this admiration. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They left at about four in the morning, and her husband put around her shoulders the simple coat he had brought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Its poorness clashed with the elegance of her ball dress, so she hurried away to avoid being seen by the rich women. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At home she took off her coat before the mirror to see herself in all her glory once more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But suddenly she gave a cry, for the necklace was no longer around her neck.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "a", "d", "a", "m", "e", " ", "F", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", "i", "e", "r", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "r", "d", "r", "o", "b", "e", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", " ", "j", "e", "w", "e", "l", " ", "b", "o", "x", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "C", "h", "o", "o", "s", "e", ",", " ", "m", "y", " ", "d", "e", "a", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", ",", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", " ", "s", "a", "t", "i", "n", " ", "b", "o", "x", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", 